msgid "ext3 文件系统"
msgstr "ext3 filesystem"

msgid "范围与配置"
msgstr "Scope and configuration"

msgid ""
"``CONFIG_EXT3_FS`` 默认内置，选择 ``m`` 可生成 ``fs/ext3/ext3.ko``。ext3 前端 通过 "
"``CONFIG_EXT_FS_COMMON`` 选择共享的 ext 引擎；若其他 ext 前端已内置， 共享引擎也保持内置。模块使用 ``fs-"
"ext3`` 别名，挂载和在途操作持有前端与 共享引擎的所有权。"
msgstr ""
"``CONFIG_EXT3_FS`` is built in by default; selecting ``m`` produces "
"``fs/ext3/ext3.ko``. The ext3 frontend selects the shared ext engine "
"through ``CONFIG_EXT_FS_COMMON``; the engine remains built in if another "
"ext frontend is built in. The module uses the ``fs-ext3`` alias, and "
"mounts and in-flight operations retain ownership of the frontend and "
"shared engine."

msgid ""
"ext3 使用经典直接、间接块映射和内部日志。识别要求 ``HAS_JOURNAL`` 及兼容的 经典 ext 特性；带 ext4 "
"特性的卷不会被显式的 ext3 挂载当作 ext3。外部日志 和未支持的磁盘特性不在此范围内。日志损坏或恢复失败时，卷不能继续以可写 状态使用。"
msgstr ""
"ext3 uses classic direct and indirect block mappings and an internal "
"journal. Identification requires ``HAS_JOURNAL`` and compatible classic "
"ext features; an explicit ext3 mount does not treat a volume with ext4 "
"features as ext3. External journals and unsupported on-disk features are "
"outside this scope. A volume cannot continue writable after journal "
"corruption or failed recovery."

msgid "使用"
msgstr "Use"

msgid ""
"以下命令使用未挂载的目标分区。ReliefOS 的用户环境提供 e2fsprogs 的 ``mkfs.ext3``；内核磁盘管理格式化使用原生 "
"ext3 格式化器。"
msgstr ""
"These commands use an unmounted target partition. The ReliefOS userspace "
"supplies ``mkfs.ext3`` from e2fsprogs; kernel disk-management formatting "
"uses the native ext3 formatter."

msgid ""
"不指定数据模式时，内核使用 ordered 日志语义；显式 ``data=ordered`` 也可用。 "
"事务保护元数据，提交前先刷新相关数据和日志；该机制不保证崩溃后所有文件 数据都恢复到应用期待的内容。"
msgstr ""
"When no data mode is specified, the kernel uses ordered journal "
"semantics; explicit ``data=ordered`` is also supported. Transactions "
"protect metadata, with the relevant data and journal flushed before "
"commit. This does not guarantee that all file data will have the content "
"expected by an application after a crash."

msgid "日志与格式化"
msgstr "Journal and formatting"

msgid ""
"原生格式化器使用 512 字节扇区、4 KiB 文件系统块和 inode 8 的内部 JBD 日志。 日志大小采用 e2fsprogs "
"的默认分档，最小文件系统为 8 MiB。格式化器初始化 日志和间接块、位图、组描述符及备份超级块，并在发布主超级块之前执行设备 "
"刷新。写入或刷新失败会返回错误，部分写入可能已经发生。"
msgstr ""
"The native formatter uses 512-byte sectors, 4 KiB filesystem blocks, and "
"an internal JBD journal in inode 8. Journal sizes follow the e2fsprogs "
"default tiers, with an 8 MiB minimum filesystem. The formatter "
"initializes the journal and indirect blocks, bitmaps, group descriptors, "
"and backup superblocks, then flushes the device before publishing the "
"primary superblock. Write or flush errors are returned and partial writes"
" may already have occurred."

msgid ""
"挂载时共享引擎检查特性和日志状态，按需重放已提交事务；同步时先提交和检查点 日志，再刷新设备。支持的日志特性和介质布局由实际解析与校验决定，不代表"
" 所有 Linux ext3 或 ext4 扩展均可写入。"
msgstr ""
"At mount time the shared engine checks features and journal state and "
"replays committed transactions when needed. Sync commits and checkpoints "
"the journal before flushing the device. Supported journal features and "
"disk layouts depend on the actual parser and validation; not all Linux "
"ext3 or ext4 extensions are writable."

msgid "验证"
msgstr "Validation"

msgid ""
"``tools/test_ext3_format.py`` 使用原生格式化器和宿主 e2fsprogs 检查最小卷、 "
"跨块组日志及组描述符、ext2/ext4 回归和写入、刷新失败。它还通过 20 组写入 或刷新故障注入模拟断电，使用原生日志代码恢复，再以 "
"``e2fsck`` 检查；独立的 ``e2fsck`` 也会重放已提交的日志。这些宿主测试不替代虚拟机或实际硬件验证。"
msgstr ""
"``tools/test_ext3_format.py`` uses the native formatter and host "
"e2fsprogs to check minimum-size volumes, journals and group descriptors "
"spanning groups, ext2/ext4 regressions, and write and flush failures. It "
"also simulates power loss with 20 write or flush fault-injection "
"settings, recovers with native journal code, and checks each result with "
"``e2fsck``; a separate ``e2fsck`` also replays the committed journal. "
"These host tests do not replace virtual-machine or physical-hardware "
"validation."

msgid ""
"磁盘结构参考 `Linux ext4 日志文档 "
"<https://docs.kernel.org/filesystems/ext4/journal.html>`_ 和 `Linux ext4 "
"索引节点文档 <https://docs.kernel.org/filesystems/ext4/dynamic.html>`_。"
msgstr ""
"On-disk structures are described in the `Linux ext4 journal documentation"
" <https://docs.kernel.org/filesystems/ext4/journal.html>`_ and the `Linux"
" ext4 inode documentation "
"<https://docs.kernel.org/filesystems/ext4/dynamic.html>`_."
